    <!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>AdaptAid | Home</title>

  <!-- CSS from public folder -->
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/Home.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.0/css/all.min.css">
</head>

<body>

  <header>
    <a href="/home">AdaptAid</a>
    <p>Empowering Mobility, Enabling Lives.</p>
  </header>

  <section class="main">
    <div class="main-text">
      <h2>Making Affordable Prosthetics Available To Everyone</h2>
      <p>
        Connect donors, recipients, hospitals, and manufacturers in one platform 
        to ensure no one is left behind due to lack of affordable prosthetic solutions.
      </p>

      <div class="buttons">
        <a href="/patient">PATIENTS</a>
        <a href="/hospital">HOSPITALS</a>
        <a href="/ngo">NGOs</a>
        <a href="/manufacturer">MANUFACTURERS</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <img src="https://www.karepoindia.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/What-makes-KARE-unique-1024x725.webp" alt="Prosthetic Image">
  </section>

  <section class="services">
    <h2>Services</h2>
    <div class="service-grid">
      <a href="/patient" class="service-card">
        <i class="fas fa-shoe-prints"></i> PATIENT
      </a>

      <a href="/manufacturer" class="service-card green">
        <i class="fas fa-industry"></i> MANUFACTURERS
      </a>

      <a href="/hospital" class="service-card dark">
        <i class="fas fa-hospital"></i> HOSPITAL
      </a>

      <a href="/ngo" class="service-card">
        <i class="fas fa-hand-holding-heart"></i> NGOs
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="explore-more">
    <h2>Explore More</h2>
    <div class="explore-grid">
      <a href="/testimonials" class="explore-card">
        <i class="fas fa-comments"></i> TESTIMONIALS
      </a>

      <a href="/partners" class="explore-card">
        <i class="fas fa-handshake"></i> PARTNERS
      </a>

      <a href="/faq" class="explore-card">
        <i class="fas fa-question-circle"></i> FAQ
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="why-us">
    <h2>WHY CHOOSE US ?</h2>
    <div class="why-us-content">
      <img src="https://cdnph.upi.com/svc/sv/i/5421743005100/2025/1/17430053577981/New-material-lets-amputees-adjust-prosthetic-fit-using-a-smartphone.jpg" alt="Prosthetic User">
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="features">
    <div class="feature">
      <strong>1. Smart Prosthetics with NFC Integration</strong><br>
      Each prosthetic comes with an NFC tag, allowing users to access real-time support, maintenance logs, and diagnostics through the app for improved care and convenience.
    </div>

    <div class="feature">
      <strong>2. One Unified Platform for All Stakeholders</strong><br>
      Our LimbLink Network brings together patients, doctors, hospitals, manufacturers, NGOs, and donors, making prosthetic care more accessible, transparent, and collaborative.
    </div>

    <div class="feature">
      <strong>3. Affordable and Sustainable Prosthetic Care</strong><br>
      We refurbish and redistribute prosthetics to create a cost-effective, eco-friendly system, ensuring mobility solutions are available to all without compromising quality.
    </div>
  </section>

</body>
</html>
